  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_001": "Jiuniang 0 0 1",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_001.1": "儿子出生时酿酒，等到金榜题名时才能开封。",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_001.2": "§b逐渐恢复灵力。",
  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_002": "Jiuniang 0 0 2",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_002.1": "女儿出生时酿酒，等到嫁亲时才能开封。",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_002.2": "§b获得幸运和水下呼吸的效果。",
  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_003": "Jiuniang 0 0 3",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_003.1": "因杜康始造而得名。",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_003.2": "§b逐渐恢复精力。",
  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_004": "Jiuniang 0 0 4",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_004.1": "多种草药酿制的药酒，喝下后大补。",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_004.2": "§b恢复血量和灵力与精力。",
  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_005": "Jiuniang 0 0 5",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_005.1": "口感醇厚，回味悠长，有独特的地瓜浓香味。",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_005.2": "§b获得辟谷效果。",
  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_006": "Jiuniang 0 0 6",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_006.1": "原本只是被忘记的越冬果实发酵而成，但自从猴子们染上了酒瘾，就开始主动酿制。",
  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_007": "Jiuniang 0 0 7",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_007.1": "带有淡淡的桃花香味，口感绵软回味悠长。",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_007.2": "§b获得炼灵修炼加持状态，修炼时可以获得更多修为。",
  "item.yvanchuxiuzhen.jiuniang_008": "Jiuniang 0 0 8",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_008.1": "由血精与灵芝酿造的邪酒，非修习血道功法的人喝，就像喝剧毒一样。",
  "tooltip.yvanchuxiuzhen.item.jiuniang_008.2": "§b为修习血道功法者提高修为。",
